('01krv02n2p9t4j53dzkx74tgxn', '01krbkv12wrnh5cqenp6vktwyg', '01KRV02N0E6WA6P4ZWSNCHACKG', 'Wednesday', 'Propose 3 Improvements for STEM Club Strengthening.', NULL, 'Develop practical and scalable recommendations such as: (1) structured mentorship programs (e.g., university student support), (2) provision of simple and low cost STEM activity kits, and (3) regular monitoring and inter school competitions. Ensure inclusivity by promoting participation of girls and students from different learning backgrounds. Focus on sustainability and ease of implementation in low resource settings.', NULL, 0, '2026-05-17 19:55:17', '2026-05-17 19:55:17'),
('01krv02n35kt3ps8bw53tb0582', '01krbkv12wrnh5cqenp6vktwyg', '01KR6C70SY4FVXTGWY1BX88BJ9', 'Friday', 'Workshop for students expected 105  students from 35 schools based in Nyamagana and Ile ela districts.', 'Field', 'Conduct workshop for 105 students from two districs Nyamagana and Ilemela with the aim of introducing CHOMOZA STEM project to them and introduction of STEM clubs and labs to them.', NULL, 1, '2026-05-17 19:55:17', '2026-05-17 19:55:17'),
('01krv02n37ghxpab9mwf29dq6d', '01krbkv12wrnh5cqenp6vktwyg', '01KR6C70SY4FVXTGWY1BX88BJA', 'Thursday', 'Develop Draft Stakeholder Engagement Map', 'Office', 'Identify and categorize key stakeholders (government, universities, schools, partners). Define their roles, level of influence and engagement strategies. Ensure inclusion of diverse stakeholders, including female educators, local leaders, and community actors. Map communication channels and frequency of engagement.', NULL, 2, '2026-05-17 19:55:17', '2026-05-17 19:55:17'),
('01krv02n39q8gatvj2b4t3yky6', '01krbkv12wrnh5cqenp6vktwyg', '01KR6C70SY4FVXTGWY1BX88BJB', 'Thursday', 'Conducting workshop to 35 teachers echq from one school from Nyamagana and Ilemela districts.', 'Field', 'Onboarding teachers on what STEM clubs and STEM lab is,teaching about their importance and what makes it easy for them to use our virtual lab and registering schools for competition.', NULL, 3, '2026-05-17 19:55:17', '2026-05-17 19:55:17'),
('01krv02n3c995r2w6p82evwt3e', '01krbkv12wrnh5cqenp6vktwyg', '01KR6C70SY4FVXTGWY1BX88BJC', 'Tuesday', 'Review and Summarize CHOMOZA Implementation Priorities', 'Office', 'Conduct an internal review of program goals, timelines and key focus areas. Align priorities with national STEM and education strategies. Ensure inclusion of gender responsive approaches and focus on underserved and rural schools. Highlight key deliverables and areas requiring immediate action.', NULL, 4, '2026-05-17 19:55:17', '2026-05-17 19:55:17'),
('01krv02n3fhx0h9gwxs2ayy27d', '01krbkv12wrnh5cqenp6vktwyg', '01KR6C70SY4FVXTGWY1BX88BJD', 'Monday', 'Presentation to Isamilo International School to onboard new clients.', 'Field', 'Presentations to the students on the demonstrations done and develop new clients.', NULL, 5, '2026-05-17 19:55:17', '2026-05-17 19:55:17'),
