('01krv1nhdztwq93s56jt3rqkrz', '01krr7bjtjeqepaxpcxr18ks7h', '01KRR7BJS09J0ZPFWK97B0Q14P', 'Saturday', 'Reflection and  documentation on what was done over the travel.', 'Office', 'Conduct brief reflection on field activities, document key observations, and prepare follow-up actions for engaged schools.', NULL, 0, '2026-05-17 20:23:04', '2026-05-17 20:23:04'),
('01krv1nhe1tddr0r3mdn3j64gy', '01krr7bjtjeqepaxpcxr18ks7h', '01KRR7BJS09J0ZPFWK97B0Q14Q', 'Friday', 'Travelling back from Mbeya to Mwanza', 'Field', 'Return travel from Mbeya to Mwanza.', NULL, 1, '2026-05-17 20:23:04', '2026-05-17 20:23:04'),
('01krv1nhe48y9evdzrbrka06pv', '01krr7bjtjeqepaxpcxr18ks7h', '01KRR7BJS09J0ZPFWK97B0Q14R', 'Thursday', 'Visiting secondary government schools to onboard them on CHOMOZA STEM project and ongoing competition.', 'Field', 'Introduce CHOMOZA program, including STEM clubs, STEM labs(both physical and virtual) and the ongoing STEM competition. Clearly explain benefits to students and teachers (skills development, innovation, exposure). Provide simple onboarding steps and expectations for participation. Encourage schools to register and actively engage. Ensure inclusion by promoting equal participation of girls and boys, and encouraging involvement of students from diverse learning abilities.Document feedback, interest levels, and potential challenges for follow up support.', NULL, 2, '2026-05-17 20:23:04', '2026-05-17 20:23:04'),
('01krv1nheaz53wxt7zcxvkxfcz', '01krr7bjtjeqepaxpcxr18ks7h', '01KRR7BJS09J0ZPFWK97B0Q14S', 'Wednesday', 'Meeting with the Vice Councellor together with education expertise ot MUST.', 'Office', 'The meeting will involve establishing a strategic partnership with Mbeya University of Science and Technology (MUST) the CHOMOZA Program will engage the institution as a research partner to support evidence based STEM education initiatives while also mobilizing university STEM students as mentors to guide and inspire learners in school based STEM clubs. The collaboration will further position MUST as a technical consultant in curriculum development and teacher training leveraging their academic expertise to strengthen the quality and relevance of STEM delivery in schools. Discussions will highlight mutual benefits including practical experience for university students,enhanced learning outcomes for schools and opportunities for joint research and innovation. The engagement will ensure inclusivity by promoting participation of female students, teachers and underserved schools while also proposing a structured and paid consultancy framework with clearly defined roles, deliverables and accountability to guarantee sustainability and long term impact.', NULL, 3, '2026-05-17 20:23:04', '2026-05-17 20:23:04'),
('01krv1nheck91fb0h2b9tknrvd', '01krr7bjtjeqepaxpcxr18ks7h', '01KRR7BJS09J0ZPFWK97B0Q14T', 'Tuesday', 'Meeting with Regional Executive Officer  of Mbeya Region.', 'Office', 'Conduct meeting so as to effectively introduce the Adilisha program to Regional Executive Officer in Mbeya by raising awareness of its key components, including STEM clubs, school based STEM labs, and the ongoing STEM competition, while fostering understanding, interest, and active participation among government,science teachers and students.', NULL, 4, '2026-05-17 20:23:04', '2026-05-17 20:23:04'),
('01krv1nhef6y89wy9f94vwkkmw', '01krr7bjtjeqepaxpcxr18ks7h', '01KRR7BJS09J0ZPFWK97B0Q14V', 'Monday', 'Travel from Mwanza to Mbeya', 'Field', 'Ensure official introduction of Adilisha and CHOMOZA program. Emphasize alignment with national education priorities. Include discussion on government support for STEM and gender inclusion. Capture feedback and approval pathways.', NULL, 5, '2026-05-17 20:23:04', '2026-05-17 20:23:04'),
