('01ksak2sgwy7fpzvveybrhyvz1', '01ksak2sgb2eh6evvpfzrajmnm', '01KSAK2SF7DBC3HJSJRV3EAQVB', 'Monday', 'Departure to Kigali, Rwanda.', 'Field', 'Early morning departure from Tanzania to Kigali, border immigration and travel clearance, arrival and hotel check-in in Kigali followed by rest and preparation for boot camp activities the next day.', NULL, 3, '2026-05-23 17:16:01', '2026-05-23 17:16:01'),
('01ksak2sgx6r1vdg0na6bc1qdr', '01ksak2sgb2eh6evvpfzrajmnm', '01KSAH60AT4M09BP6R5JMBXRN3', 'Tuesday', 'Bootcamp Day 1 – 27th May', 'Field', 'Registration and official opening session, Introduction to the boot camp program and objectives, Keynote presentations from facilitators and partners\r\nGroup formation and team-building activities', NULL, 4, '2026-05-23 17:16:01', '2026-05-23 17:16:01'),
('01ksawda1ke86xqrapw0ryytgy', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAWDA0DKWEJFACJ74YKS322', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksawda1my6vbyhtrc5b1c2em', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAWDA0DKWEJFACJ74YKS323', 'Friday', 'Session concerning  Collaboration,innovation and future action.', 'Field', 'I am expected to participate in a session focusing on collaboration, innovation, and future action in STEM and TVET education. The session is expected to highlight the importance of working together among different stakeholders such as educators, institutions and policymakers to improve education outcomes.\r\nIt is also expected to explore innovative ideas and approaches that can be applied to improve teaching and learning in STEM and TVET with emphasis on creativity and problem solving. In addition the session will discuss future action plans on how to sustain and scale successful practices for long term impact.', NULL, 1, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksawda1n71tc4qbz9cwj2rrn', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAWDA0DKWEJFACJ74YKS324', 'Thursday', 'Participating in the session about applied  STEM pedagogy and industrial relevant teaching.', 'Field', 'I am expected to participate in a session on applied STEM pedagogy and industrial relevant teaching, focusing on how STEM education can be connected to real life industry needs. The session is expected to explore practical teaching approaches that help students understand how science, technology, engineering and mathematics are used in real workplaces.\r\nIt is also expected to highlight the importance of linking classroom learning with practical skills required in industries, so that students are better prepared for employment and innovation. The session will emphasize hands on learning, problem-solving and using real world examples to make STEM subjects more meaningful and relevant.', NULL, 2, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksawda1q8hq3edxzb1y03zh5', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAWDA0DKWEJFACJ74YKS325', 'Wednesday', 'Participation in the STEM and TVET Pedagogical Innovation Bootcamp (Day 1) focusing on innocative stem teaching methods.', 'Field', 'On Day 1 of the STEM and TVET Pedagogical Innovation Bootcamp I am expected to participate in sessions focusing on the policies and frameworks that guide STEM and TVET education, as well as pedagogical transformation. The sessions are expected to explain how education policies influence the design and implementation of STEM and TVET programmes in different countries. It is also expected that discussions will cover the shift from traditional teaching methods to more modern, competency based and learner centered approaches aimed at improving practical skills and student learning outcomes. Overall, the day is expected to provide a better understanding of how policies, curriculum frameworks and innovative teaching methods are connected in improving STEM and TVET education.', NULL, 3, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksawda1rertkvvbhghvtfc3y', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAWDA0DKWEJFACJ74YKS326', 'Tuesday', 'Travel from Mwanza to Rwanda for participation in the bootcamp.', 'Field', 'The travel to Rwanda is undertaken to participate in the STEM and TVET Pedagogical Innovation Bootcamp for AU member states. The purpose of the travel is to enhance pedagogical skills and gain exposure to innovative teaching methodologies in STEM and TVET education. The bootcamp will provide a platform for professional development through practical sessions, knowledge sharing and collaboration with educators from different countries.\r\nThe participation is also intended to strengthen the implementation of the CHOMOZA STEM project by improving teaching approaches used in STEM clubs and supporting teacher capacity building. Additionally the engagement will facilitate networking and contribute to the exchange of best practices in STEM and TVET education across Africa.', NULL, 4, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksawda1sqc0s9xzkqwp5zyyt', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAWDA0DKWEJFACJ74YKS327', 'Monday', 'Reporting on previous field activities, including travel to Mbeya and Dar es Salaam, and submission of weekly updates.', 'Office', '•Successfully travelled to Mbeya to engage with Mbeya University of Science and Technology (MUST) to strengthen collaboration on STEM clubs, teacher training and research partnership under the CHOMOZA project.\r\n•Held a productive engagement meeting with MUST to support ongoing programme implementation and build stronger institutional collaboration.\r\n•Successfully conducted a media interview with Crown Media where key messages on STEM education, STEM clubs and Adilisha programme objectives were shared to increase public awareness and visibility.', NULL, 5, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksawda1vqs4ehmbdns0000e6', '01ksawda1exhyx0jx458aq25g3', '01KSAVF3DJZNRXW5XMBY0K7NJF', 'Tuesday', 'Meeting with Regional Executive Officer  of Mbeya Region.', 'Office', 'Carried from weekly report: Partially done - The planned meeting with the Regional Education Officer was not conducted due to the delay in obtaining the required official permit for conducting program activities in regions outside the assigned operational area. As per protocol, such engagements require prior authorization to ensure compliance with regional administrative procedures.\r\nDespite being present and prepared for the meeting, the absence of the permit limited the ability to formally proceed with the engagement. Follow up actions will include securing the necessary approvals in advance to ensure smooth coordination and successful meetings in future regional visits.', NULL, 6, '2026-05-23 19:59:03', '2026-05-23 19:59:03'),
('01ksb64mgpmr74w94txahdj7tr', '01ksb64mghat0ykdtwb2w2m0sd', '01KSB64MFH412GGYNZ5JVCQVZ6', 'Monday', 'Post on social media\r\nOffice', 'Office', 'Share organisation activity updates and organization awareness content', NULL, 0, '2026-05-23 22:49:04', '2026-05-23 22:49:04'),
