('01krra2pn7ytehhafvw1ejfds6', '01krra2pmk7xapm9mcr6sek94m', 'Successfully held a productive meeting with the District Education Officer regarding the establishment of a new STEM Lab in Nyamagana District, where guidance and support toward the process were positively discussed and the preparation of the Proposal and a Concept note is ongoing.', 1, '2026-05-16 18:52:21', '2026-05-16 18:52:21'),
