('01krrwnp7a6t50r8mh3se3gb9f', '01krrtdrnsdjpp08fy10yy7v9q', '## Key Achievements\r\n\r\nConducted successful STEM workshops in Ilemela District and Nyamagana District, where teachers were trained on Thursday and students on Friday. The training strengthened teachers’ capacity to deliver practical STEM learning using hands-on approaches, while students gained exposure to interactive STEM activities that improved their creativity, problem-solving, and interest in science and technology. The sessions also increased awareness of Adilisha STEM initiatives and national competitions, helping to strengthen school engagement and participation readiness across both districts.', 0, '2026-05-17 00:17:17', '2026-05-17 00:17:17'),
('01krrwnp7a6t50r8mh3se3gb9g', '01krrtdrnsdjpp08fy10yy7v9q', 'Increased overall school participation in Adilisha STEM competitions through teacher registrations, with schools actively engaging both teachers and students in STEM lab activities and competition readiness.', 1, '2026-05-17 00:17:17', '2026-05-17 00:17:17'),
