('01ksae7q0w3s96qeyvvknt963v', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Thursday - Develop Draft Stakeholder Engagement Map', NULL, 'Done', 'Stakeholder Engagement Map\r\n\r\nStakeholder engagement for the CHOMOZA STEM programme involved key actors at different levels of implementation and support.\r\n\r\nAt the government level engagement focused on education authorities including the Regional Education Office (REO) and District Education Officers (DEO) to ensure alignment of programme activities with education priorities and to support school access and coordination.\r\n\r\nAt the institutional level discussions and engagement continued with various universities to strengthen collaboration in areas such as research partnership, STEM club mentorship and teacher training support.\r\n\r\nAt the school level engagement involved school heads and science teachers to support the implementation of STEM clubs, labs and competition activities. These stakeholders play a key role in day to day programme delivery.\r\n\r\nThe Adilisha team continued internal coordination to ensure smooth implementation of planned activities, including school visits and programme onboarding.', 'Well completed.', 0, 0, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q0xw969xc8f8r3vav88', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Tuesday - Review and Summarize CHOMOZA Implementation Priorities', NULL, 'Done', 'The CHOMOZA project implementation is primarily focused on strengthening STEM education in secondary schools through a holistic and practical approach. Key priorities include the establishment and strengthening of STEM clubs to enhance student engagement and interest in science and mathematics, alongside the development of school based STEM laboratories to support hands on learning and experimentation. Another major priority is capacity building for teachers through targeted training and mentorship, ensuring effective delivery of STEM content and practical sessions. The project also emphasizes promoting gender inclusion by addressing barriers that limit girls’ participation in STEM fields. Additionally stakeholder engagement remains critical, involving collaboration with government institutions, universities and local partners to ensure sustainability and scalability of interventions. Overall CHOMOZA prioritizes improving learning outcomes, fostering innovation and creating an enabling environment for both students and teachers in STEM education.', 'Will be implemented to  ensure  success.', 0, 1, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q0xw969xc8f8r3vav89', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Wednesday - Propose 3 Improvements for STEM Club Strengthening.', NULL, 'Done', 'I came up with three strong and practical improvements for strengthening STEM clubs.Which are\r\n1. Structured Mentorship Programs\r\n\r\nIntroduce a consistent mentorship system by engaging university students and professionals in STEM fields to support club members. Mentors can guide students through experiments, projects, and career pathways, helping to bridge the gap between theory and real world application while increasing motivation and confidence, especially among girls.\r\n\r\n2. Hands on Learning Resources and Projects\r\n\r\nEquip STEM clubs with practical learning materials and simple laboratory kits to promote experimentation and innovation. Encouraging project based learning (e.g., building models, conducting experiments, solving local problems) will enhance students’ understanding of scientific concepts and improve performance in science and mathematics.\r\n\r\n3. Regular Competitions and Showcases\r\n\r\nOrganize internal and inter school STEM competitions, exhibitions and innovation days where students can present their projects. This fosters creativity, teamwork and healthy competition, while also increasing visibility of the clubs and encouraging more students to participate.', 'Will be implemented to ensure\r\n Stem clubs  will       be succesful.', 0, 2, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q0ytjekm7z5wnqyky5b', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Monday - Presentation on the MOEST 2026/27 budget in relation to Adilishas work', NULL, 'In progress', 'The planned presentation to the Ministry of Education, Science and Technology (MOEST) was not conducted during this week as I was not present at the office due to official travel commitments. The presentation will be rescheduled and prioritized in the upcoming week to ensure timely engagement and alignment with relevant stakeholders.', 'Will  be rescheduled.', 0, 3, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q0ytjekm7z5wnqyky5c', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Friday - Travelling back from Mbeya to Mwanza', NULL, 'Done', 'Following the media engagement in Dar es Salaam I travelled back to Mwanza to conclude the week’s activities. The return journey marked the completion of key assignments  including stakeholder engagement and media outreach. Upon arrival  time was allocated for internal reporting, documentation of outcomes, and planning for follow up actions to ensure continuity of the partnerships and visibility efforts initiated during the week.', 'Was successful.', 0, 4, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q0zhrn1v8wthnpmqy8q', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Thursday - Visiting secondary government schools to onboard them on CHOMOZA STEM project and ongoing competition.', NULL, 'Done', 'Following the successful meeting in Mbeya I travelled to Dar es Salaam to participate in a media interview with Crown Media. The purpose of the interview was to increase visibility of Adilisha’s work highlighting key initiatives such as STEM clubs, school based laboratories and the ongoing STEM competition. The engagement provided an opportunity to communicate the organization’s impact particularly in improving science and mathematics education and addressing the gender gap in STEM  thereby strengthening public awareness and stakeholder interest.', 'It was very successful.', 0, 5, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q0zhrn1v8wthnpmqy8r', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Wednesday - Meeting with the Vice Councellor together with education expertise ot MUST.', NULL, 'Done', 'A strategic meeting was successfully conducted with Dr. Tekka from the College of Innovation, Technology and Transfer (CITT) at Mbeya University of Science and Technology (MUST) with the aim of introducing Adilisha’s programs and exploring potential collaboration opportunities. During the meeting key initiatives such as the establishment of STEM clubs, development of school based STEM laboratories, and the ongoing STEM competition were presented, with emphasis on improving science and mathematics education and addressing the gender gap in STEM. Discussions further explored possible areas of partnership, including engaging MUST as a research partner involving university students as mentors in STEM clubs and providing technical support in teacher training and curriculum development. The meeting was positively received with mutual interest expressed in collaboration and agreement to follow up on formalizing the partnership and identifying actionable next steps.', 'Formally writing the proposal for our  collaboration.', 0, 6, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q10s5axw8a9ahm4zced', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Tuesday - Meeting with Regional Executive Officer  of Mbeya Region.', NULL, 'Partially done', 'The planned meeting with the Regional Education Officer was not conducted due to the delay in obtaining the required official permit for conducting program activities in regions outside the assigned operational area. As per protocol, such engagements require prior authorization to ensure compliance with regional administrative procedures.\r\nDespite being present and prepared for the meeting, the absence of the permit limited the ability to formally proceed with the engagement. Follow up actions will include securing the necessary approvals in advance to ensure smooth coordination and successful meetings in future regional visits.', 'Process will continue.', 1, 7, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksae7q10s5axw8a9ahm4zcee', '01ksae7q0p2914zxx8zvr1vhkt', NULL, 'Monday - Travel from Mwanza to Mbeya', NULL, 'Done', 'The trip was successful and i reached Mbeya safe and sound.', 'Well accmplished.', 0, 8, '2026-05-23 15:51:19', '2026-05-23 15:51:19'),
('01ksah4j47dymcwyh4mqr58w6p', '01ksah4j40dgjbe1xzvmybphk4', NULL, 'Saturday - Compiling reports and  feedbacks on the trip to Arusha', NULL, 'Done', 'Documentation and feedbacks were given and received at the right time.', 'Report submissions and storage.', 0, 0, '2026-05-23 16:42:02', '2026-05-23 16:42:02'),
('01ksah4j47dymcwyh4mqr58w6q', '01ksah4j40dgjbe1xzvmybphk4', NULL, 'Friday - Return travel from Arusha to Mwanza', NULL, 'Done', 'successful return from Arusha.', NULL, 0, 1, '2026-05-23 16:42:02', '2026-05-23 16:42:02'),
('01ksah4j48f9ks1e65v2hj3shd', '01ksah4j40dgjbe1xzvmybphk4', NULL, 'Monday - Trip from Mwanza to Arusha', NULL, 'Done', 'successful arrival in Arusha.', NULL, 0, 2, '2026-05-23 16:42:02', '2026-05-23 16:42:02'),
('01ksah4j48f9ks1e65v2hj3she', '01ksah4j40dgjbe1xzvmybphk4', NULL, 'Tuesday - Meeting with Regional Education Officer for introduction and permissions', NULL, 'Not started', 'Failure to visit the Regional Education Office.', 'Next meeting will be arranged either through phone or a visit.', 1, 3, '2026-05-23 16:42:02', '2026-05-23 16:42:02'),
('01ksah4j49nz16sb8aq2hw9d2h', '01ksah4j40dgjbe1xzvmybphk4', NULL, 'Thursday - Twende Offices visit.', NULL, 'Done', 'During my visit to TWENDE Makerspace in Njiro, Arusha, I was exposed to an innovation hub focused on STEM education, creativity, and hands-on learning. I learned how the makerspace supports students and young innovators through practical activities and  problem-solving projects, while also encouraging collaboration, mentorship, and research-based learning.', 'Exploring a possible partnership between TWENDE Makerspace and Adilisha Tanzania, planning joint STEM workshops and student innovation activities, and identifying opportunities for mentorship and training programs.', 0, 4, '2026-05-23 16:42:02', '2026-05-23 16:42:02'),
('01ksah4j49nz16sb8aq2hw9d2j', '01ksah4j40dgjbe1xzvmybphk4', NULL, 'Wednesday - Visit the Nelson Mandela African Institution of Science and Technology.', NULL, 'Done', 'A field visit was conducted to the Nelson Mandela African Institution of Science and Technology where discussions were held with the Director Dr. Efraim Kosia on potential collaboration in STEM education, innovation, research, and curriculum development with Adilisha. The visit highlighted opportunities for partnership through innovation activities, curriculum stakeholder validation, participation in Nelson Mandela Innovation Week, and engagement with postgraduate research programs. Emphasis was placed on developing an impact-driven collaboration framework supported by practical implementation and measurable outcomes.', 'Preparing a Proposal and a concept Note that is specific.', 0, 5, '2026-05-23 16:42:02', '2026-05-23 16:42:02'),
('01ksamwxj32jxscwv268g6rmar', '01ksam9rasgwy8q9sqpc2jdz7m', NULL, '__off_plan__', 'Develop STEM Innovation Labs Concept Note', 'Done', 'Completed', 'follow-up on proposal progress', 0, 0, '2026-05-23 17:47:45', '2026-05-23 17:47:45'),
('01ksamwxj32jxscwv268g6rmas', '01ksam9rasgwy8q9sqpc2jdz7m', NULL, '__off_plan__', 'Develop BRINK Project Proposal', 'Done', 'Proposal preparation with MUCE paused because the process is continuing with a professor in London', 'Continue communication and follow-up on proposal progress', 0, 1, '2026-05-23 17:47:45', '2026-05-23 17:47:45');
